  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This charming Seaside cottage is conveniently located on Pensacola Street, just steps from the beach. It features a private driveway (with two parking passes), three bedrooms, three full baths, an outdoor shower, and a semi-private backyard. \"Downtown\" Seaside is a five minute walk. <br><br>The front walkway introduces the house with a \"Golden Spiral\" design. The entrance features a large wrap-around covered porch with seating for dining and entertaining. Entering the cottage, you are greeted by a comfortable open living space featuring a seating area with 65” tv. Dining for 6+, galley kitchen, and entertainment area (music, books, games, game table) flow from there. Murals by acclaimed artist Flournoy Holmes (\"Eat a Peach\" album cover, half a dozen WSP album packages) enhance two walls. Two queen suites and one twin/single bedroom occupy three corners of the cottage.<br><br>Out the back door is a small covered porch with beach toys, beach chairs, bikes and skim boards. Down the stairs is a tranquil garden area with table and seating for 6.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Welcome to Idlewild South! Steps to both downtown and the beach."
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
